    <preface>
      <p>Customs Tariff Amendment (Incorporation of Proposals) Act 2021</p>
      <p>No. 107, 2021</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Customs Tariff Act 1995</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
